I left out the `aap:caps/http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `StateHandle<'subscriptions', read>`, and the graph definition hasn't been updated to add HTTP. Calling an external host would also exceed the node's declared authority, and `RunInfo` has no text field for the enrichment query. Once the graph grants the capability, I can add it.

